  "review_status": "decision-level answers reviewed by two bridge engineers",
  "input": {
    "structured_en": "[Span arrangement] One continuous unit of five spans, 30 + 30 + 30 + 30 + 30 m (centre-to-centre of bearings), precast girders simply supported during erection and made continuous afterwards; deck width 9 m.\n[Section and material] Precast prestressed small box girders, 3 per span; middle-girder section at midspan: depth 1.6 m; top width 2.40 m; flange 0.18 m thick at the tip, thickening by 6.3 cm over a 19.2 cm long haunch next to the web; bottom slab 1.00 m wide and 0.18 m thick; top slab 0.18 m thick; webs 0.20 m thick (measured horizontally) with outer faces inclined at 1:4; 15 cm x 7 cm chamfers at the upper corners of the cell; girder concrete C50. Consider the self-weight of the main girders only (no wet joints, diaphragms, pavement or barriers).\n[Bearings and boundary] Abutment 0, Pier 1, Pier 3, Pier 4 and Abutment 5: PTFE sliding laminated elastomeric bearings, two under each girder end; effective plan size 300 mm x 400 mm, five internal rubber layers 8 mm thick. Pier 2: plain laminated elastomeric bearings (fixed), two under each girder end; effective plan size 300 mm x 400 mm, five internal rubber layers 8 mm thick.\n[Design standard] Highway Class I loading (JTG D60-2015); one-way traffic, carriageway width 8 m, two design lanes.",
    "structured_zh": "【跨径布置】一联五跨，跨径 30 + 30 + 30 + 30 + 30 m（支座中心线间距），先简支后连续；桥面全宽 9 m。\n【截面与材料】预制预应力混凝土小箱梁，每跨 3 片；中梁跨中截面：梁高 1.6 m；顶宽 2.40 m；翼缘端部厚 0.18 m，近腹板处经 19.2 cm 长加腋增厚 6.3 cm；底板宽 1.00 m、厚 0.18 m；顶板厚 0.18 m；腹板水平厚 0.20 m，外侧坡度 1:4；箱内顶角设 15 cm × 7 cm 倒角；主梁混凝土 C50。只计主梁自重（不计湿接缝、横隔板、铺装与护栏）。\n【支座与边界】0 号台、1 号墩、3 号墩、4 号墩、5 号台：四氟滑板式板式橡胶支座，每个梁端 2 个；有效平面尺寸 300 mm × 400 mm，中间橡胶层 5 层、每层厚 8 mm。2 号墩：普通板式橡胶支座（固定），每个梁端 2 个；有效平面尺寸 300 mm × 400 mm，中间橡胶层 5 层、每层厚 8 mm。\n【设计标准】公路-I 级（JTG D60-2015）；单向行驶，行车道宽 8 m，设计车道数 2。"
  },
